诸侯。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"2齊田和會魏文侯、楚人、衞人于濁澤，求爲諸侯。魏文侯爲之請於王及諸侯，王許之。","content_fanyi":"齐国田和在浊泽会同魏文侯、楚人、卫人，谋求取得诸侯名位。魏文侯替田和向周安王及各国诸侯陈请，周安王准予所请。","content_jianti_auto":"2齐田和会魏文侯、楚人、衞人于浊泽，求为诸侯。魏文侯为之请于王及诸侯，王许之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":55,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 安王 / 十三年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8bfd66ee-db0e-11ef-987c-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-389},"tongjian_id":"8bfd66ee-db0e-11ef-987c-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"濁澤","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"王氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"王氏","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c0d8fed-db0e-11ef-a9ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周靈王","people_name_jianti_auto":"周灵王","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c0d8fee-db0e-11ef-b529-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8c0d8fef-db0e-11ef-acd7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"齊王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐王","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8c0d8ff0-db0e-11ef-a7ee-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田和","people_name_jianti_auto":"田和","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"8c0d8ff1-db0e-11ef-ae4a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"姬","people_name_jianti_auto":"姬","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"8c0d8ff2-db0e-11ef-983e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏信陵君","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏信陵君","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8c0d8ff3-db0e-11ef-9492-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"比干","people_name_jianti_auto":"比干","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"8c0d8ff4-db0e-11ef-a155-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"紂","people_name_jianti_auto":"纣","start_index":96,"tongjian_id":"8c0d8ff5-db0e-11ef-b058-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_