nti_auto":"东莱","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"8c0d9006-db0e-11ef-8ab0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"8c0d9007-db0e-11ef-9ae2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"殷","place_name_jianti_auto":"殷","start_index":90,"tongjian_id":"8c0d9008-db0e-11ef-a6d3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":128,"tongjian_id":"8c0d9009-db0e-11ef-9464-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"姓譜：王氏之所自出非一。出太原、琅邪者，周靈王太子晉之後。北海、陳留，齊王田和之後。東海出自姬姓。高平、京兆，魏信陵君之後。天水、東平、新蔡、新野、山陽、中山、章武、東萊、河東者，殷王子比干爲紂所害，子孫以王者之後，號曰王氏。余謂此皆後世以諸郡著姓言之耳。春秋之時自有王姓，莫能審其所自出。","note_content_jianti_auto":"姓谱：王氏之所自出非一。出太原、琅邪者，周灵王太子晋之后。北海、陈留，齐王田和之后。东海出自姬姓。高平、京兆，魏信陵君之后。天水、东平、新蔡、新野、山阳、中山、章武、东莱、河东者，殷王子比干为纣所害，子孙以王者之后，号曰王氏。余谓此皆后世以诸郡著姓言之耳。春秋之时自有王姓，莫能审其所自出。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c0d8fec-db0e-11ef-a8a3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"公孫","people_name_jianti_auto":"公孙","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c0d900c-db0e-11ef-9fa6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"黃帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"黄帝","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c0d900d-db0e-11ef-ba47-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"公孫氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"公孙氏","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c0d900e-db0e-11ef-be47-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"公孫，姓也。黃帝，公孫氏。頎，渠希翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"公孙，姓也。黄帝，公孙氏。颀，渠希翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8c0d900b-db0e-11ef-b80e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"徐廣","people_name_jianti_auto":"徐广","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c0d9010-db0e-11ef-b097-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"pl