notes":[],"note_content":"史記正義曰：徐廣以爲長社濁澤，非也。括地志云：濁水源出蒲州解縣東北平地，爾時魏都安邑，韓、趙伐魏，豈至河南長社邪！解縣濁水近於魏都，當是也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史记正义曰：徐广以为长社浊泽，非也。括地志云：浊水源出蒲州解县东北平地，尔时魏都安邑，韩、赵伐魏，岂至河南长社邪！解县浊水近于魏都，当是也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8c0d900f-db0e-11ef-bb57-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8c0d8feb-db0e-11ef-9580-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"qí","source_anchor_text":"奔韓公孫頎謂韓懿侯","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":12,"text":"頎","tongjian_id":"75a248c5-c126-5420-b655-754f3d03c082"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"濁澤","place_name_jianti_auto":"浊泽","resolved_place_entity_id":3332,"start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"8c0d902d-db0e-11ef-83cd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"又《魏世家》：惠王初立，韩懿侯、赵成侯。合兵伐魏，战于浊...","context_before":"浊泽[《括地志》：出解县东北平地，即涿水也。涿，音浊。","source_end_index":44,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"1d0a34bb-866b-51fc-869d-65e217e3e958","source_start_index":27,"source_text":"《史记》：赵成侯六年，伐魏取涿泽。"},{"context_after":"徐广以为河南之浊泽，误也。今湮]。","context_before":"...，即涿水也。涿，音浊。《史记》：赵成侯六年，伐魏取涿泽。","source_end_index":87,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"1d0a34bb-866b-51fc-869d-65e217e3e958","source_start_index":44,"source_text":"又《魏世家》：惠王初立，韩懿侯、赵成侯。合兵伐魏，战于浊泽，魏氏大败。是时，魏都安邑。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"又七里为三亭冈。秦王稽与范雎言：待我三亭之南。即此。○蔡...","context_before":"鸡鸣城[在县西南三十里。","source_end_index":43,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a5278a9d-1b2e-5ef5-85e6-269ce5d76ae2","source_start_index":12,"source_text":"《竹书》：魏惠成王元年，韩伐魏，军于捴泽陂，北对鸡鸣城。是也。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"3魏大夫王錯出奔韓。公孫頎謂韓懿侯曰：「魏亂，可取也。」懿侯乃與趙成侯合兵伐魏，戰于濁澤，大破之，遂圍魏。成侯曰：「殺罃，立公中緩，割地而退，我二國之利也。」懿侯曰：「不可。殺魏君，暴也；割地而退，貪也。不如兩分之。魏分爲兩，不強於宋、衞，則我終無魏患矣。」趙人不聽。懿侯不悅，以其兵夜去。趙成侯亦去。罃遂殺公中緩而立，是爲惠王。","content_fanyi":"魏国大夫王错出逃到韩国。公孙颀对韩懿侯说：“魏国混乱，可以攻取。”韩懿侯便与赵成侯合兵攻打魏国，在浊泽交战，大败魏军，随后包围了魏国都城。赵成侯说：“杀掉魏罃，改立公中缓，让魏国割地后退兵，这对我们两国都有利。”韩懿侯说：“不行。杀掉魏国国君，是暴虐；割地后退兵，是贪婪。不如让魏国一分为二。魏国分成两国后，国力就不会强于宋国、卫国，我们便永远不会再有魏国的祸患了。”赵成侯不肯听从。韩懿侯很不高兴，当夜率领自己的军队撤走。赵成侯也撤兵离去。魏罃于是杀死公中缓，自立为国君，这就是魏惠王。","content_jianti_auto":"3魏大夫王错出奔韩。公孙颀谓韩懿侯曰：「魏乱，可取也。」懿侯乃与赵成侯合兵伐魏，战于浊泽，大破之，遂围魏。成侯曰：「杀䓨，立公中缓，割地而退，我二国之利也。」懿侯曰：「不可。杀魏君，暴也；割地而退，贪也。不如两分之。魏分为两，不强于宋、衞，则我终无魏患矣。」赵人不听。懿侯不悦，以其兵夜去。赵成侯亦去。䓨遂杀公中缓而立，是为惠王。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":111,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 烈王 / 七年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c0d8feb-db0e-11ef-9580-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-369},"tongjian_id":"8c0d8feb-db0e-11ef-9580-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"濁澤","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"䱸","people_name_jianti_auto":"𫠑","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8c5c61c8-db0e-11ef-988b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"申差","people_name_jianti_auto":"申差","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8c5c61c9-db0e-11ef-9899-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"脩魚","place_name_jianti_auto":"修鱼","place_note":"河南原阳","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c5c61ca-db0e-11ef-a82f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"觀澤","place_name_jianti_auto":"观泽","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8c5c61cb-db0e-11ef-9ca7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏州","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"8c5c61cc-db0e-11ef-92e3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"頓丘縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"顿丘县","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"8c5c61cd-db0e-11ef-a11c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"敗，補邁翻。索隱曰：脩魚，地名。䱸、申差，二將名。索，山客翻。將，卽亮翻。䱸，音瘦，又疏鳩翻。「濁澤」，年表作「觀澤」。括地志，觀澤在魏州頓丘縣東十八里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"败，补迈翻。索隐曰：修鱼，地名。𫠑、申差，二将名。索，山客翻。将，即亮翻。𫠑，音瘦，又疏鸠翻。「浊泽」，年表作「观泽」。括地志，观泽在魏州顿丘县东十八里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c5c61c7-db0e-11ef-b4ab-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8c5c61c6-db0e-11ef-afb4-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"sōu","source_anchor_text":"級虜其將䱸申差于濁","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":18,"text":"䱸","tongjian_id":"4292cb97-4f25-5386-8a75-39ba6aa1f15e"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"濁澤","place_name_jianti_auto":"浊泽","resolved_place_entity_id":3332,"start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8c5c61d6-db0e-11ef-9a28-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"晋永康二年，赵王伦篡位，王盛等聚众于浊泽，谋讨伦，为伦将...","context_before":"...侯。又齐威王败魏于浊泽，围魏，魏请献观以和。《韩世家》：","source_end_index":117,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"5e9ac492-dda2-57cd-bba3-59b5a33204fb","source_start_index":95,"source_text":"宣惠王十六年，秦败我修鱼，虏将昚申差于浊泽。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"1秦敗韓師于脩魚，斬首八萬級，虜其將䱸、申差于濁澤。諸侯振恐。","content_fanyi":"秦军在修鱼击败韩军，斩首八万人，并在浊泽俘虏了韩军将领䱸和申差。各国诸侯都因此震动恐惧。","content_jianti_auto":"1秦败韩师于修鱼，斩首八万级，虏其将𫠑、申差于浊泽。诸侯振恐。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":229,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三 (周紀三) / 愼靚王 / 四年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c5c61c6-db0e-11ef-afb4-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-317},"tongjian_id":"8c5c61c6-db0e-11ef-afb4-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"濁澤","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"離狐縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"离狐县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9d754d36-db0e-11ef-a36f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"前漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"前汉","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9d754d37-db0e-11ef-929a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"东郡","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9d754d38-db0e-11ef-a7b7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"后汉","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"9d754d39-db0e-11ef-ae9d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"9d754d3a-db0e-11ef-90ee-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"濟陰郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"济阴郡","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"9d754d3b-db0e-11ef-a45a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"9d754d3c-db0e-11ef-a89e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南華縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"南华县","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"9d754d3d-db0e-11ef-8762-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄆州","place_name_jianti_auto":"郓州","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"9d754d3e-db0e-11ef-8efd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"離狐縣，前漢屬東郡，後漢、晉屬濟陰郡，唐天寶元年，改爲南華縣，屬鄆州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"离狐县，前汉属东郡，后汉、晋属济阴郡，唐天宝元年，改为南华县，属郓州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"9d754d35-db0e-11ef-8324-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9d754d42-db0e-11ef-b7b7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9d754d43-db0e-11ef-8cda-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張","people_name_jianti_auto":"张","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"9d754d44-db0e-11ef-befc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：孔本「處」上正有「王」字；張校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：孔本「处」上正有「王」字；张校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"9d754d41-db0e-11ef-b219-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"晉書作「王處穆」。","note_content_jianti_auto":"晋书作「王处穆」。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"9d754d3f-db0e-11ef-bf21-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"濁澤","place_name_jianti_auto":"浊泽","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9d754d46-db0e-11ef-9743-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潁川","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍川","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9d754d47-db0e-11ef-8d6a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長社縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"长社县","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9d754d48-db0e-11ef-9e70-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"濁澤在潁川長社縣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"浊泽在颍川长社县。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"9d754d45-db0e-11ef-b66f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"冏","people_name_jianti_auto":"冏","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"9d754d4a-db0e-11ef-a2f2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"盛","people_name_jianti_auto":"盛","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"9d754d4b-db0e-11ef-be40-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"穆","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"9d754d4c-db0e-11ef-84c0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"倫","people_name_jianti_auto":"伦","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"9d754d4d-db0e-11ef-96bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"襲","people_name_jianti_auto":"袭","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"9d754d4e-db0e-11ef-8fa7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"穆","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"9d754d4f-db0e-11ef-9d3b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"倫","people_name_jianti_auto":"伦","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"9d754d50-db0e-11ef-a87f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：齊王冏傳曰：「冏潛與盛、穆謀起兵誅倫，未發，恐事泄，乃與襲殺穆，送首於倫，以安其意。」今從三十國春秋。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：齐王冏传曰：「冏潜与盛、穆谋起兵诛伦，未发，恐事泄，乃与袭杀穆，送首於伦，以安其意。」今从三十国春秋。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"9d754d49-db0e-11ef-8386-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"9d754d55-db0e-11ef-9fc4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"歆","people_name_jianti_auto":"歆","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"9d754d56-db0e-11ef-ba1e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"扶風王","people_name_jianti_auto":"扶风王","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"9d754d57-db0e-11ef-bf92-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"駿","people_name_jianti_auto":"骏","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"9d754d58-db0e-11ef-b12a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"後漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"后汉","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"9d754d59-db0e-11ef-81ec-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"晉志曰：四中郞將，並後漢置；武帝以來，四中郞將或領刺史，或持節爲之。歆，扶風王駿之子也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"晋志曰：四中郞将，并后汉置；武帝以来，四中郞将或领刺史，或持节为之。歆，扶风王骏之子也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"9d754d54-db0e-11ef-a7d2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"征、鎭，四征、四鎭，居方面者。","note_content_jianti_auto":"征、镇，四征、四镇，居方面者。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"9d754d5b-db0e-11ef-b1bb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"濁澤","place_name_jianti_auto":"浊泽","resolved_place_entity_id":3332,"start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"9d754d64-db0e-11ef-a6c5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、晋 十六国（卷三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"南渡封域，广狭无常，然上明[见晋荆州注]、江陵、夏口、武...","context_before":"","source_end_index":72,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e51298ae-3895-577f-9d62-b0014ea3c381","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"迨贾氏煽乱，八王构兵[八王，汝南王亮、楚王玮、赵王伦、齐王冏、长沙王乂、成都王颖、河间王颙、东海王越也]，群翟起而乘之，于是中原板荡，不可复问。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/三、晋 十六国（卷三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷四十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"又永嘉四年，刘聪遣其子粲等犯洛阳，既而石勒出成皋关，围陈...","context_before":"...年，关东州郡皆起兵讨董卓。曹操议引兵西据成皋，诸将不听。","source_end_index":977,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b082787f-7bb9-59b8-ad1b-1f69020d2286","source_start_index":934,"source_text":"晋永康三年，赵王伦篡逆，齐王冏起兵许昌讨之。伦遣兵分道拒冏，使其党司马雅等自成皋关出。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷四十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"观，今山东观城县]。","context_before":"...，秦败我修鱼，虏将昚申差于浊泽。晋永康二年，赵王伦篡位，","source_end_index":153,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"5e9ac492-dda2-57cd-bba3-59b5a33204fb","source_start_index":129,"source_text":"王盛等聚众于浊泽，谋讨伦，为伦将管袭所败，即此。"},{"context_after":"或谓之延寿城。《嵩山记》：王子晋学道于洛鹿涧，涧旁有灵星...","context_before":"○延寿关[在县南三十五里。","source_end_index":44,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c7a555ed-1457-56ff-bb48-2023d710ddac","source_start_index":13,"source_text":"晋永康二年，齐王冏举兵许昌，讨赵王伦，伦遣兵出延寿关，以拒之。"},{"context_after":"梁大通三年，陈庆之送元颢北还，至梁国，魏人分兵镇荥阳、虎...","context_before":"...里。许由所隐，亦曰许由山。有崿坂关，东出阳翟、许昌之道。","source_end_index":75,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8dedc2b0-ae46-53de-aa34-0451257f5ee2","source_start_index":51,"source_text":"晋齐王冏举兵许昌，讨赵王伦，伦遣兵出堮坂关拒之。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、河南府（卷四十八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"或谓之延寿城。《嵩山记》：王子晋学道于洛鹿涧，涧旁有灵星...","context_before":"○延寿关[在县南三十五里。","source_end_index":44,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f2f9ebbb-d89e-5a72-adc7-0a0712ceece2","source_start_index":13,"source_text":"晋永康二年，齐王冏举兵许昌，讨赵王伦，伦遣兵出延寿关，以拒之。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/二、河南府（卷四十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"5齊王冏謀討趙王倫，未發，會離狐王盛、潁川處穆聚衆於濁澤，百姓從之，日以萬數。倫以其將管襲爲齊王軍司，討盛、穆，斬之。冏因收襲，殺之，與豫州刺史何勗、龍驤將軍董艾等起兵，遣使告成都王穎、河間王顒、常山王乂及南中郞將新野公歆，移檄征、鎭、州、郡、縣、國，稱：「逆臣孫秀，迷誤趙王，當共誅討。有不從命者，誅及三族。」","content_fanyi":"齐王司马冏正在谋划讨伐赵王司马伦，尚未发兵，适逢离狐人王盛、颍川人处穆在浊泽聚众，百姓追随他们，每天以万计。司马伦让部将管袭出任齐王军司，讨伐王盛、处穆，将二人斩首。司马冏乘机拘捕并处死管袭，随后与豫州刺史何勖、龙骧将军董艾等人一同起兵，派使者通告成都王司马颖、河间王司马颙、常山王司马乂以及南中郎将新野公司马歆，并向征、镇、州、郡、县、国传檄，声言：“逆臣孙秀迷惑、妨害赵王，应当共同讨伐。有不听从命令的人，诛灭三族。”","content_jianti_auto":"5齐王冏谋讨赵王伦，未发，会离狐王盛、颍川处穆聚众于浊泽，百姓从之，日以万数。伦以其将管袭为齐王军司，讨盛、穆，斩之。冏因收袭，杀之，与豫州刺史何勗、龙骧将军董艾等起兵，遣使告成都王颖、河间王颙、常山王乂及南中郞将新野公歆，移檄征、镇、州、郡、县、国，称：「逆臣孙秀，迷误赵王，当共诛讨。有不从命者，诛及三族。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":7167,"number":5,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第八十四 (晉紀六) / 孝惠皇帝中之上 / 永寧元年 / 第 12 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"9d754d34-db0e-11ef-b0b3-a0d3651f611f","year_int":301},"tongjian_id":"9d754d34-db0e-11ef-b0b3-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":4},"place_name":"濁澤","resolved_profile":{"entity_id":3332,"entry_list_str":"濁澤","intro":"战国至西晋时期见于史籍的古泽名，位于今河南省长社县（今长葛市）一带，为当时重要会盟与战场地点。","lat_max":34.3,"lat_min":34.1,"lon_max":113.9,"lon_min":113.7,"modern_location":"今河南省长葛市附近","show_map":true,"standard_name":"浊泽","type_code":"water"}},"message":"success","success":true}